<title>HONG KONG: Shui On Construction debuts at HK$9.45.</title>
<headline>Shui On Construction debuts at HK$9.45.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shui On group unit Shui On Construction and Materials Ltd made their trading debut at HK$9.45 per share, compared with an issue price of HK$9.30.  </p>
<p>The share price swiftly retreated to HK$9.00 in the first 10 minutes of trade as 276,000 shares worth HK$2.58 million changed hands.</p>
<p>Shui On Construction, a construction materials supplier and construction firm, offered 65 million shares at HK$9.30 per share in its flotation, of which 14.63 million shares available for public subscription were 14.03 times subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
